Z||000005||theogre||11-05-1999||08:50 PM||||You need to know for absolute certain what ignition the motor was built for. DIS and distributor setups use completely diferant cranks.<P>block wise, don't know. <P>serpent belt, should be a non issue. Fieros came with that to.||||reg||1
